## Notes
- DO NOT execute code yourself - delegate to worker subtasks
- ALWAYS reset to base commit before applying patch
- DO NOT change `/testcase/base_commit_hash`
- Check if `/testcase/repo_changes.diff` exists (Builder may have made changes)
- Patch should NOT introduce new sanitizer errors
- Patch should NOT harm code functionality
